      "q": "How much does the federal government spend on NAICS 339112?",
      "a": "The federal government obligated $99.8M on NAICS 339112 for FY2027 to date. Fiscal-year obligations were $1.1B in FY22, $1.5B in FY23, $2B in FY24, $1.6B in FY25, and $1.1B in FY26. The FY2027 to date total arrived through 427 awards with an average award size of $234K and obligations fell 91.0% year over year."
